# The screenshot board IS committed — images and all. It is the one artefact
# of this project meant to be looked at rather than run, so it has to survive
# a clone. `node tools/board.mjs` regenerates it in place; they are downscaled
# JPEGs for exactly this reason.
#
# The working captures below are not: they are what the tools produce while a
# screen is being worked on, they are full-size PNGs, and the board is the
# thing that is supposed to be kept.
